{"id":"01000000-7cf4-7592-b5cd-08df1596b8de","electionID":"GE2026","name":[{"languageID":"en","text":"2026 General Election"},{"languageID":"1","text":"2026 General Election"}],"date":"2026-11-03T00:00:00","dateWrittenOut":[],"availableUntil":"2026-11-04T00:00:00","availableStarting":"2026-09-18T20:05:00","runOffOnlyStarting":null,"includeRunOffBallot":false,"instructions":[{"languageID":"en","text":"<p>To make your voting choices, please follow the instructions provided on this site.</p><p>You will need to return your voted ballot by mail to your County Board of Elections.</p>"},{"languageID":"1","text":"<p>Para hacer sus elecciones de votaci&oacute;n, siga las instrucciones proporcionadas en este sitio.</p>\r\n<p>Deber&aacute; devolver su boleta votada por correo a la Junta Electoral de su condado. Debe recibirse en persona a m&aacute;s tardar el cierre de las urnas el d&iacute;a de las elecciones, o tener matasellos a m&aacute;s tardar el d&iacute;a de las elecciones y debe recibirlo la Junta Electoral no m&aacute;s de 7 d&iacute;as despu&eacute;s de las elecciones.</p>\r\n<p>Election Test</p>"}],"ballotStyles":null,"maxBallotPrintsAllowed":1000,"maxBallotSubmissionsAllowed":1,"electionBallotHistory":null,"hasConfirmationCodes":false,"enableBallotSkipToDownload":false}